This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The shared-memory field layout (VirtualDesktop.BodyState / FaceState at
offset 0, 360 bytes), the 70 expression weight indices, the gating flags,
the eye-openness formula and the mapping to Unified Expressions were
informed by the MIT-licensed VRCFT module
VirtualDesktop.VRCFaceTracking (https://github.com/guygodin/VirtualDesktop.VRCFaceTracking)
by Virtual Desktop, Inc. This repository is an independent C++ implementation
of that wire format and contains none of its source code; the upstream
sources were consulted read-only under .tmp-upstream/ (not distributed).

